        "subject": "LU-9512 llite: Reserve OBD_CONNECT2_TMPFILE flag",
        "message": "LU-9512 llite: Reserve OBD_CONNECT2_TMPFILE flag\n\nReserve flag OBD_CONNECT2_TMPFILE value 0x200000000000ULL\nThis will help new client(having tmpfile) to find out if\nit is running against old server(running without tmpfile\nsupport).\n\nAdds \"UNKNOWN\" Connect flags, which was missing.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 757cc8869906 (\"LU-20808 ptlrpc: add OBD_CONNECT2_DNE_INTENT\")\nSigned-off-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nChange-Id: I0cee3fdcb022b11bb3e84b6fd51c46638a0ea5e8\n"
      },
